{"text": "Tom swept his brush. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Back and forth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Like an artist. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He stepped back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To look at the effect. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And added a touch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Here and there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ben watched every move. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And became more and more interested. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Say, Tom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Let me whitewash a little. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He said at last. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> No, Ben, I cannot. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Aunt Polly is very particular. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> About this fence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Oh, please let me try. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will give you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The core of my apple. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Well, no, Ben. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am afraid. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Tom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will give you all of it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Cried Ben. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom gave up the brush. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With an unwilling face. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But a happy heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While Ben worked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And sweated in the sun. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom sat in the shade. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And ate the apple.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "o", "m", " ", "s", "w", "e", "p", "t", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "b", "r", "u", "s", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "a", "c", "k", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "o", "r", "t", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "L", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", "n", " ", "a", "r", "t", "i", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "s", "t", "e", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "b", "a",